# character-class range benchmarks

- ascii_ident_classes
D pcre
M ^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.-]{63}$
S alpha_ident_0123456789_ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ.abcdef-7890123
N 5000
R 1
X

- printable_span
D pcre
M ^[\x20-\x7e]{64}$
S !"#%&'()*+,-./0123456789:;<=>?@ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ[\]^_`a
N 5000
R 1
X

- negated_newline
D pcre
M ^[^\x0a\x0d]{64}$
S 0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ_-
N 5000
R 1
X

- full_byte_range
D pcre
M ^[\x00-\xff]{64}$
S 0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ_-
N 5000
R 1
X

- disjoint_multibyte_bands
D pcre
M ^(?:[\x01-\x1f]|[\x21-\x5f]|[\x61-\x7e]|[\x80-\xbf]|[\xc2-\xf4]){64}$
S ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ_abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz!0123456789
N 5000
R 1
X
Q
